OL,4,CPT's shopping centre sprint in memory  
OL,5,Cof friend                              
OL,6,GA personal trainer has organised a run 
OL,7,Garound an empty shopping centre in     
OL,8,Gmemory of his friend who died by       
OL,9,Gsuicide.                               
OL,11,FAlex Graham, 24, led a group of        
OL,12,Frunners on the 5k (3.1-mile) route     
OL,13,Fthrough Gateshead's Metrocentre for    
OL,14,Fhis friend Ben Goodman, who took his   
OL,15,Fown life this summer.                  
OL,17,FThe money raised by the event will be  
OL,18,Fdonated to the North East suicide      
OL,19,Fcharity If U Care Share.               
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
