OL,4,CTeen's poetry bridging gap between     
OL,5,Ccultures                               
OL,6,GMore than 20 years ago, Karena moved   
OL,7,Gfrom Hunan in China to study in the    
OL,8,GUK, where she has lived ever since.    
OL,10,FShe felt that a lot of her Chinese     
OL,11,Fculture got "lost in translation" and  
OL,12,FBritish people could not always relate.
OL,14,FYears later, it is a similar sentiment 
OL,15,Fexpressed by her teenager daughter     
OL,16,FYuhe, who grew up in Stockton-on-Tees  
OL,17,Fsurrounded by both cultures and is     
OL,18,Fusing poetry to help understand her    
OL,19,Fidentity.                              
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
