OL,4,CHouse ramming charges in connection    
OL,5,Cwith A66 crash                         
OL,6,GPolice have charged a number of men    
OL,7,Gwith ramming houses and vehicles prior 
OL,8,Gto a crash which killed two police     
OL,9,Gofficers and five young men.           
OL,11,FTwo men and a teenage boy appeared at  
OL,12,FTeesside Magistrates' Court on         
OL,13,FThursday over events before the fatal  
OL,14,Fhead-on crash on the A66 near          
OL,15,FMiddlesbrough in August.               
OL,17,FCleveland Police said the charges      
OL,18,Frelated to two vehicles, a Volvo and   
OL,19,FLand Rover, suspected of being used to 
OL,20,Fdestroy or to cause damage to houses   
OL,21,Fand vehicles in Middlesbrough on 22    
OL,22,FAugust.                           G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
